templates.body:
Dear {{user_name}},

A sign-in to your account was detected.

Sign-in details:
- Date and time: {{date_time}}
- Device: {{device}}
- Browser: {{browser}}
- Approximate location: {{location}}

If this was you, no action is required. If you do not recognise this activity, secure your account here: {{security_url}}

Regards,
Security Team
{{company_name}}

Dear {{user_name}},

Your subscription payment has been successfully processed.

Billing details:
- Plan: {{plan_name}}
- Amount: {{amount}}
- Payment date: {{payment_date}}
- Invoice number: {{invoice_number}}
- Next billing date: {{next_billing_date}}

View your invoice: {{invoice_url}}

Thank you for using {{product_name}}.

Regards,
Billing Team
{{company_name}}

Dear {{user_name}},

We were unable to process the latest payment for your {{product_name}} subscription.

Payment details:
- Amount: {{amount}}
- Due date: {{due_date}}
- Status: {{payment_status}}

Please review your payment method and retry the payment.

Update payment details: {{billing_url}}

For assistance, contact {{billing_support_email}}.

Regards,
Billing Team
{{company_name}}

Dear {{user_name}},

We’re pleased to announce new improvements to {{product_name}}.

What’s new:
- {{feature_one}}
- {{feature_two}}
- {{feature_three}}

These updates are designed to improve your experience and help you work more efficiently.

Explore the updates: {{release_notes_url}}

Thank you for being part of our community.

Best regards,
Product Team
{{company_name}}

Dear {{user_name}},

We have scheduled system maintenance to improve the performance and reliability of {{product_name}}.

Maintenance details:
- Date: {{maintenance_date}}
- Start time: {{start_time}} {{time_zone}}
- Expected end time: {{end_time}} {{time_zone}}
- Expected impact: {{service_impact}}

Some services may be temporarily unavailable during this period. We apologise for any inconvenience and appreciate your understanding.

Regards,
Technical Operations Team
{{company_name}}

Dear {{user_name}},

We are investigating an issue affecting {{affected_service}}. Our technical team is working to restore normal service.

Current status: {{incident_status}}
Affected services: {{affected_services}}
Latest update: {{update_details}}

Follow progress on our status page: {{status_page_url}}

We apologise for the inconvenience and will share further updates as they become available.

Regards,
Technical Support Team
{{company_name}}
